# wdig.itsnotezra.com on the shared edge, started from gcloud-ovh-migrate's service template and
# installed to /srv/edge/sites/ by `make ovh-install`. DNS only, not proxied by Cloudflare; a
# proxied name adds `import cloudflare_only` and moves as CONTRACT.md §10 describes.
wdig.itsnotezra.com {
	import access_log
	import security_headers
	import compress
	# The live colour's upstream, which ci-deploy rewrites as it moves the edge from one colour
	# to the other (CONTRACT.md §3); `make ovh-install` creates it before this snippet arrives.
	import ../live/wdig.caddyfile

	# Until the name's DNS points at the host the edge cannot prove it, and failed attempts
	# lock a name out of Let's Encrypt. Delete this line once the record has moved; the real
	# certificate follows within seconds (CONTRACT.md §10).
	tls internal
}
